window.products.push({"id":855151,"name":"JOVERS 3.5mm Earphone Adaptor for Phone Xs/Xs Max/XR/ 8/8 Plus/X (10) / 7/7 Plus, Audio Splitter Accessories Music Aux Adapter Headphone Dongle 3.5mm ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CdqsaqeWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Jupiter Melody Water Ionizer JP104 includes a number of features to give you the healthiest water with simplicity. With easy one-touch operation, select from the 9 pH settings and a voice indicator alerts you to your selection. You can also adjust the volume level or simply switch the sound ON or OFF as you desire. To eliminate the guess work you no longer have to remember when your water filter was last changed. The Melody has a digital indicator to tell when you when you need to change your water filter as optimum performance is achieved when the water filter is changed on time. The new colored LCD display allows for easy identification of your pH selections and has easy to understand symbols and colors identifying the water type and level that you have selected. The revolutionary Melody Water Ionizer offers Jupiter's new amazing infrared filter system for maximum purity, energization and filtration ability. The Melody was the first water ionizer to always produce alkaline water even while it is cleaning. With precise technology to ensure maximum performance, the Melody can produce alkaline or acidic water of 9 different pH levels. To keep your water ionizer in top working condition, the Melody also includes patented DARC (double action reverse cleaning) system which completely removes any scale from the electronic cell. You can choose to attach your Melody to either your tap or directly to the water line below your counter. You can also install your Melody below the counter by using one of the double spouted, above-counter faucets. Feel confident with your purchase with our 90 day Unconditional Guarantee. No returns on opened product. A 15% restocking will apply to all returns","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CdqsaqeWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jupiter Science Water","source_asin":"B001TLNDXU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001TLNDXU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001TLNDXU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":855152,"name":"HAVLULAND Bath Towel Set Bathroom, Shower Towels, Luxury Hotel & Spa Towels, 100% Cotton Super Soft and Absorbent Towels, Extra Large 27x54 inch - Bei","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z0JhAV-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 -PIECE 100% PREMIUM TURKISH COTTON TOWEL SET (27\" x 54'') These high-quality hotel and spa collection Turkish towels are made from 100% premium Turkish cotton which allows them to be extremely absorbent, soft and fluffy. Experience a true luxury super soft feel every time you use them. The surface is smooth and not easy to shed, adding to their durability. Edges are reinforced with double needle embroidered stitching to prevent fraying from long-term use and laundering. Perfect for spa, poolside, bathroom, Beach, salon, college dorm room essentials. Each towel is spun from 100% combed cotton - soft, durable, quick-dry, and wonderfully absorbent. It is more absorbent than any Turkish Cotton. Absorbent Turkish cotton is a premium cotton that has extra-long fibers, which makes Turkish towels delightfully absorbent! Turkish Cotton, being one of the most uniquely produced cotton fibers worldwide provides our daily lives with a soft touch that you would not be able to feel anywhere or with any other cotton substitute. 100% Turkish Cotton brings superior quality when it comes to Softness & Absorbency. Premium Quality Towels are 600 to 900 GSM, which make them thicker compared to normal towels, also provides more durability & comfort. These towels are made using 100% Turkish cotton which are super soft & Plush. The softness of these towels will ensure comfort in your daily lives. Perfect combination of softness and strength, the towel set is ideal for everyday usage. Use the towels efficiently in a bathroom, at gym, beach, poolside, salon, spa or even camping trip. CARE INSTRUCTIONS : Machine washable towels. We recommend washing in cold water or Warm Water before your first use. This will cause the cotton fibers to open up and give the towels better absorbency. Tumble dry on low heat or hang them to dry. Please don’t use fabric softener, dry sheets .Chemicals will only reduce the softness of the material. SET INCLUDES: 4 Bath Towels: 27 x 54 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z0JhAV-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAVLULAND","source_asin":"B0BL1WQ82M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL1WQ82M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL1WQ82M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
