window.products.push({"id":855263,"name":"Ash & Harry Fish Spatula, Nonstick Metal Oven Utensils, Premium Stainless Steel Slotted Turner with Flexible Blade for Frying, Turning, and Grilling S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jlPVYh-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Forget flimsy silicone spatulas and get a spatula that can get the job done. Try the Beard Steel nonstick spatula. While most people want to prepare healthy meals for their family every day, it can be a challenge—especially if you don’t have the right tools. A fish fillet, for example, can lose its tasty appearance if it crumbles when you lift it off the frying pan. With our best-selling fish turner, you don’t have to be a professional chef to prepare mouth-watering dishes in the comfort of your own kitchen! This all-purpose slotted spatula features a 100% rustproof, stainless steel construction. Though the blade is slightly flexible, it is still sturdy enough to flip or lift fish and other foods with ease without bending. Also, it is completely nonstick and won’t scratch your expensive cookware. The handle of the spatula is heat resistant and comfortable to hold, so it reduces the strain on your wrists. Unlike other cooking utensils, Beard Steel’s nonstick spatula is less likely to harbor bacteria, molds, and mildew. And its polished surface makes it easy to clean. Keep it in a utensil caddy with your other favorite cooking tools. The fish flipper has long, wide holes in the middle to let excess oils drain from the food before serving it. With the spatula measuring 12.5 x 3.1 x 0.7 inches and the blade 5.8 x 3.1 x 0.7 inches, it is large enough to accommodate bigger food like one whole fish, large chunks of beef, or sausages. We care about you and your health! So enjoy our awesome e-book, “Effective Ways To Get A Healthy Body,” absolutely for FREE with every purchase! So why wait? Choose us now! Your purchase is backed by a 1-year comprehensive warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jlPVYh-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beard Steel","source_asin":"B07LDRMM61","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LDRMM61","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LDRMM61","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
