window.products.push({"id":855377,"name":"12PCS – Napkin Rings, Gold Napkin Rings Set of 12, Holiday Napkin Holders for Dining, Anniversary, Birthday, Christmas, Easter, Fall, Halloween, Thank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u1qk9+YqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Best Table Decor】It’s never too early to start planning your fall dinner table decor. It’s all about pinpointing stylish accents that embody the spirit of the holiday season—and our gold napkin rings suit the overall aesthetic of your home. And these elegant gold napkin rings will shine on your table. 【Suit Holiday Table】Our decorative gold napkin rings set of 12 will suit any holiday table at Dining, Anniversary, Birthday, Christmas, Candlelight Dinner, Easter, Fall, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Holiday, Party, Father’s Day, Mother’s day, and so on. The simple addition of napkin ring can display your attention to detail and add a dose of glam to your table set-up. 【Design & Color】While thanksgiving napkins holders are available in a slew of styles and finishes, for the holiday season, you really can't go wrong with a design in a luxe gold finish. From subdued designs, these gold napkin ring holders will enhance your holiday table. These napkin ring holders are made of sturdy metal with gold hollow design. And they are easy to clean, so that you can reuse them. 【Package Includes】You will receive gold Christmas napkin rings set of 12, and the size of each napkin ring is 1.8inches in diameter and 1.14inches in width. Napkin rings can complete a formal place setting to make the table look elegant, or simply keep a casual table neat. 【Important】If you are not satisfied with our products or have any questions, you can contact us and we will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u1qk9+YqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luney","source_asin":"B0BVHT5KP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVHT5KP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVHT5KP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
