window.products.push({"id":855382,"name":"Briwax Toluene Free Furniture Wax 16 oz - Tudor Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q83NxLrVL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","description":"Briwax is a blend of beeswax and carnauba wax, an all natural product. Use on: wood, leather, marble, concrete, metal or properly cured painted surfaces. Prevents oils and salts (fingerprints) from harming the surface finish. Cleans white water rings. An inherent cleaning solvent in the wax is cleans grease and grime off the surface before it evaporates. Various dye colors suspended in the wax allows it to diminish minor scratches without changing the character or color of the piece. Leaves a beautiful finish that is easily maintained. Result is reversible, simple remove with mineral spirits (paint thinner). Due to the nature of this product, we cannot accept returns or refund money on any opened and/or used items. Wood craftsmen around the world have used BRIWAX to protect, restore and recondition fine furniture and antiques to their original \"patina\" which could only be duplicated by laborious hand rubbing before the BRIWAX blend. This unique \"craftsman's choice\" is now available to American professional woodworkers and refinishers, as well as the quality conscious homeowner who simply wants to keep their furnishings or antiques in top condition. DIRECTIONS: To ensure desired results always test on inconspicuous area first Use Briwax sparingly, a little goes a long way Gently rub the area Always buff after each application of Briwax If the wax smudges, you've used too much Briwax Requires more drying time than original Briwax Safety cautions: Highly flammable KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN Note: Briwax may turn into liquid in hot weather during transportation in a hot delivery truck, therefore do not open immediately upon its arrival. This in no way diminishes the quality of the product. Simply allow the container to come to room temperature to return to a paste form. FINISHES/COLORS Actual finishes/colors of p","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q83NxLrVL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Briwax","source_asin":"B07C594SGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C594SGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C594SGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
