window.products.push({"id":855474,"name":"Meyerascal Cloud Key Holder for Wall, Strong Magnetic Force Can Hang Multiple Keys, Magnetic Keys Ring Holder for Door, Easy to Install and Convenient","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MpkMdpa0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Commitment： We take full responsibility for the quality of our products.Any question,please feel free to contact us. Specifications： Material：ABS+Neodymium Magnets Size：10 x 11 x 3.0 cm / 3.9 x 4.4 x 1.2 in Color：White Weight: Approx. 100 g / 2.52 oz Features： 1.Constructed out of ABS plastic, the key holder is durably crafted to last and is sure to earn you compliments with its unique design. 2.The White Cloud Magnetic Wall Key Holder will keep your keys within easy reach and neatly stored while adding a cute finishing touch to your decor. 3.Perfect for mounting in hallways, in the kitchen, in your bedroom and in dorm rooms, the White Cloud Magnetic Wall Key Holder looks just like a fluffy white cloud. 4.The White Cloud Magnetic Wall Key Holder is easier to use than other key holders on the market today. You don't have to use screws or hardware to mount it; the key holder has an adhesive back that allows you to simply press it into place. 5.Loose keys and keychains will stay securely against the key holder, but are easy to remove. If you ever need to move the key holder, you don't have to worry, as its adhesive won't damage your walls. 6.A great gift for a housewarming, a birthday or the winter holidays, the White Cloud Magnetic Wall Key Holder has a fun, charming look that both men and women love. Notes： 1.Due to the light and screen setting difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. 2.Please allow slight dimension difference due to different manual measurement.   -----Never lose your keys again and add something unique to your decor with the best key holder on Amazon! Order the White Cloud Magnetic Wall Key Holder now！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MpkMdpa0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meyerascal","source_asin":"B08FZ6XGQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FZ6XGQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FZ6XGQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":855475,"name":"RNK Shops Monogrammed Damask Shower Curtain - 69\"x70\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817pTAwNhwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Completely revamp any bathroom in your home with one of our shower curtains! Our personalized shower curtains will brighten your bathroom by displaying your favorite colors, patterns, and graphics for the world to see! Any family member or visiting friend will adore these!These custom shower curtains are crafted from woven polyester and have sturdy slit openings at the top for easy set-up and removal of this curtain. We print your customization in vibrant colors on the front, while the back is white so that your design can stand out.We offer a few different sizes of these bathroom shower curtains, as well as the option to customize your size to suit your bathrooms needs. First, we offer a standard size that is 69 inches wide and 70 inches tall. Our second option is our extra-long shower curtain, which is 70 inches wide and 83 inches tall.Looking for a larger or smaller shower curtain? We offer a custom size bathroom curtain. For this customizable option, you can change the height to be anywhere from 36 to 100 inches, and the width can be anywhere from 24 to 200 inches. If you choose to purchase this customizable shower curtain, the price will depend on the size, as each square foot costs approximately $4.05.To clean your unique shower curtain, we recommend that you machine wash it in cold water, with like colors, and on a gentle cycle. Hang the bathroom shower curtain to dry afterward.Design Shown: Monogrammed Damask (#53905)Features:==================================== * [Quality Material]: Made from 100% woven polyester for durability and easy maintenance. * [Size Variety]: Choose from Standard, Extra Long, or Custom Size to suit your bathroom needs. * [Easy Care]: Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle and hang to dry for lasting quality. * [Printed Front & White Back]: Customization in vibrant colors on the front, with a clean white back.Care Instructions:==================================== * Machine wash, in cold water, with like colors, on a gentle cycle, and with mild detergent * Hang to allow for proper drying afterwards * Shower liner needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817pTAwNhwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B00N0ZT2Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N0ZT2Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N0ZT2Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
