window.products.push({"id":855522,"name":"Ozeri Sauce Pan and Lid with a 100% PFOA and APEO-Free Non-Stick Coating developed in the USA, 5 L (5.3 Quart), Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FjUGbReIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featuring ETERNA a safe and durable non-stick coating developed in the USA, the Stainless Steel Earth Pan by Ozeri is the world’s first stainless steel frying pan to achieve non-stick perfection without using PFOA or APEO harmful chemicals often found in traditional cookware. Conventional sauce pans achieve their non-stick performance with the aid of PFOA (PerFluoroOctanoic Acid), which the EPA has classified as a 'persistent pollutant of the environment' and APEO (Alkylphenol ethoxylates), which are under restricted use in Germany due to environmental concerns. According to the EPA, once ingested, PFOA is capable of remaining in people for a very long time, and has been shown to cause developmental and other adverse effects in laboratory animals. Likewise, European studies have shown that APEO may be toxic to aquatic life, and has the potential to act as endocrine disrupters. With the Stainless Steel Earth Sauce Pan's ETERNA coating, even under high temperatures, no such controversial chemicals are ever passed on to you, or released into the environment. This is because the Stainless Steel Earth Sauce Pan utilizes a safer non-stick coating that is completely free of PFOA, and far more durable and scratch-resistant than other non-stick surfaces. With better non-stick properties, the Stainless Steel Earth Sauce Pan consistently renders cleaning a breeze. The Stainless Steel Earth Sauce Pan by Ozeri is made of the highest quality 18/8 stainless steel with TriPly construction, delivering the ultimate in heat conductivity. It boasts a magnetized bottom for rapid heat transfer on induction stoves, and a heat-resistant handle and side helper handle for safe and comfortable handling. The Stainless Steel All-In-One Sauce Pan is elegantly finished in a polished mirror exterior, and includes a tempered glass lid with a steam-release vent and heat-resistant knob. Your satisfaction is guaranteed. ETERNA coating made by Whitford USA. Sauce pan assembled in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FjUGbReIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozeri","source_asin":"B01AOO0RU4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AOO0RU4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AOO0RU4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":855523,"name":"JINAMART 3 Section Laundry Sorter with Rolling Wheels, 3 Bag Laundry Hamper cart and Removable Bag with 4 side pockets for Extra Storage (Army Green)…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LGClb4sKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️STURDY STEEL FRAME - Compared to other laundry carts, JinaMart Laundry storage cart is built with high quality materials and durable 16mm STEEL frames, which makes it sturdy enough to hold up bulky clothes. This laundry bag sorter is not that big to take so much space and not that small to not carry all the clothes. ✔️3 REMOVABLE BAGS - This heavy duty laundry sorter features 3 large hanging bags made of odor-reducing strong 600D oxford fabric bags with inner PVC coated, the three bags can be individually removed from the laundry cart by simply lift the bag using its two metal handles. The laundry separator hamper can be taken out and with easy lifting handles, you can easily carry the bags to the laundry room ✔️ EASY TO ASSEMBLE - Our JinaMart 3 compartment laundry sorter is designed for easy use, instruction included, this laundry organizer is easy to assemble. Thanks to the practical handles, which allows you to empty the laundry basket one by one, so you don't have to carry the entire basket to the washing machine. You will be given an instruction card to guide you through assembling the laundry cart in less than 10 minutes. ✔️ MULTIPURPOSE USAGE - Our laundry bag storage has two pockets on each side for your detergents and softeners. The laundry hamper could be used in different places, such as a bedroom, laundry room, kids room, bathroom, college, campers, hotel accommodations, etc. This 3 bag laundry hamper is also a practical and creative gift idea for a family, co-worker, friends, or yourself that makes the daily task of washing clothes more bearable. ✔️100% MONEY-BACK SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Jinamart home wants you to be absolutely happy with your purchase! If you are not satisfied with your laundry sorter with a folding table for any reason, please contact us directly for a refund or replacement, or if you have any suggestions for better improvement, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LGClb4sKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JINAMART","source_asin":"B09TWS8JS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TWS8JS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TWS8JS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
