window.products.push({"id":855703,"name":"iCeeO2-700 CO2 Monitor with Curve Tracer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V1fYKNmEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Accuracy, innovative features, and unbeatable affordability in one small, user-friendly CO2 monitor. To deliver its measurements, the iCeeO2-700 carbon dioxide monitor features a clear display system that boasts a digital chart of memory-logged CO2, Relative Humidity, and Temperature readings over an adjustable 24-hour or 24-day period. With the industry-new feature Trend Chart, the device is able to trace the above quantities through past minutes, hours, or up to 7 days. Most electronics on the market today come with their own proprietary power supply or additional USB wall adapter. To reduce our planet's waste, we designed our devices to not only be energy-efficient, but Earth-friendly as well. The iCeeO2-700 is patent pending, featuring a hook-and-loop fastener along the back that can securely affix a rectangular external battery pack. By maximizing mobility, the device can be easily moved to any room - living room, kitchen, office - to monitor IAQ virtually anywhere. As shown in the pictures, the iCeeO2-700 can be powered by almost any standard USB port that provides power, such as a laptop, a wall adapter, or an external mobile battery pack (PowerBank). All you need is one of the above and a micro-USB cable (pictured battery pack and computer not included). Major Features: CO2/RH/Temperature monitor on a clear display Trend Chart: shows variable Min/Hr/Day/Wk for readings of CO2/RH/Temperature 2-Channel Low Drift NDIR (non-dispersive infrared) Gas Sensor Audible alarm for low/high CO2 levels 3 Multicolored LEDs for Easy Reading Built-in directory of common plant types of their general CO2 requirements; two slots for custom plant inputs Foolproof home key Replenish CO2 Reminder: calculates time frame based on usage from past 5 days \"Green\" Power Supply that is compatible with a standard smartphone charger. Battery, computer, not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V1fYKNmEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iCeeO2","source_asin":"B00YVOCEFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YVOCEFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YVOCEFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
