window.products.push({"id":855879,"name":"DULONG Commercial Electric Griddle Flat Top Grill HotPlate Kitchen Countertop Grill with Adjustable Thermostatic Control,Stainless Steel Restaurant La","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K-5LZLmQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description 1)This electric griddle body make by good quality stainless steel,energy-saving and safety.2)With its energy efficient hotplate,you get an even heat distribution of up to 300C on cooking surface.3)The countertop grill with the new electrothermal which is designed and developed with advance technology,be provided with thermostat function,easy to control.4)Built in grease channel and catch draws grease away from your food for easy clean5)Splash guards protect the user and surrounding walls from hot grease and oil splatte Specification Type:electric griddle grillMaterial:stainless steel+IronVoltage:110VPower:1500WOverall Dimension (LxWxH): 54*40*22CMWeight:16kg Note 1.Don't touch the electrical heating plate to avoid scald when you use this machine.2.Please take out the plug or switch the machine was stopped,it could avoid the issue happen.All safeguard maintain work should be in process after shut down the power supply.If the appears hitch,don't dismantle by yourself,please contact us for repair. Pay attention 1.The surface of the Electric Griddle is coated with a layer of protective oil and covered with a piece of oil paper.When using for the first time,wipe off the protective oil with a cloth.Apply a layer of cooking oil and start heating the machine.2.This baking trays are made of iron.Iron will turn black after use.Please apply a layer of cooking oil after use,otherwise it may rust.If the color has changed of the grill plate after use,that is normal,not a quality problem!3.We use the shipping route of the sea,and may enter a small amount of water vapor during transportation.Therefore,it is normal for a small amount of rust on the surface of the machine or a small amount of smoke during use.4.There is no non-stick coating on the surface of the electric griddle,and it is normal for the sticking pot phenomenon during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K-5LZLmQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DULONG","source_asin":"B07VKKFGT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VKKFGT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VKKFGT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
