window.products.push({"id":855900,"name":"Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set of 8 - Dual Sided Stackable Magnetic Stainless Steel Measuring Spoons for Spices Liquids - Fits in Spice Jars - with Lev","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U4mJQb14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set of 8 - Dual Sided Stackable Magnetic Stainless Steel Measuring Spoons for Spices Liquids - Fits in Spice Jars - with Leveler Features Sized for Every Task: These 7 individual different sized stainless steel measuring spoons (1/8, 1/4, 1/2, 3/4, 1 Tsp and 1/2, 1 Tbsp) with a leveler provide accurate measurements for your cooking and baking needs. Double Sized Spoons: Each magnetic spoon has the same measurement at both ends, so you can measure dry ingredients and wet ingredients with the same spoon without stopping to rinse. The round side is great for liquids and the oval side is perfect for fitting them into narrow spice jars. Fits in Most Spice Jars: These dual sided magnetic spoons have a narrow end designed to fit most spice jars. No need to shake spices onto the spoon so you will save more and waste less of your expensive spices. The measuring spoons also lay flat on the counter without spilling their contents. Easy Storage: No need to rummage through your kitchen drawer looking for a lost spoon - they all stick together magnetically. The magnets are strong enough to hold these magnetic stainless steel measuring spoons all together in a neatly fashion while still allowing them to be easily pulled apart for use. Easy Cleaning, Dishwasher Safe: Since these stackable tablespoons and teaspoons are connected by magnets, they are easy to clean, both in the dishwasher or by hand. No more clumsy rings, clips, chains or whatever to deal with.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U4mJQb14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SORANT","source_asin":"B08C79781Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C79781Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C79781Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":855901,"name":"Meal Prep Bag by Sisianti with Leak-Proof Meal Prep Containers For Fitness, For Your Workplace and Family Picnics","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81My+95GtFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Passion for making your dieting healthy and convenient - in style! Sisianti manufacturer consists of dieting and sports enthusiasts so every solution comes out of true passion for healthy dieting. That is the reason WHY, when designing this bag, the goal was to make it perfect for your all -day meal planning. Hence its: Functionality - Making it easy to organize and carry your meals There are 3 separate compartments, for your food containers, for your fruits and for your drinks and a shaker. There is the inside mesh for your utensils and the outside mesh for your phone and other things. To comfortable carrying your bag around there is the adjustable soft wide padded shoulder strap and the handle at the top of the bag. Quality and easy to clean materials To keep your meals always fresh for hours Sisianti meal prep bag uses best PEVA insulated material, 8 mm sponge and nicely looking shiny and sturdy outer material. All materials are easy to clean simply with the wet cloth. You will love Sisianti's super practical containers! Secure Lock system allows easy lid opening and closing without breaking your nails. Specially designed handles make them airtight and leak-proof food containers. 2 x XXL sizes: 2,4 l (81 oz) and 1 x S size: 0,7 l (23 oz). All containers passed the strict FDA regulations. You will always look stylish The bag is just the right size for your all-day meal when going to work, into fitness, when traveling or for your outdoor activities. When carrying the bag around you will look very stylish because the bag is designed not just with functionality in mind but also with a great style - shiny outer material emphasizes classy look with a sporty soul. Add this meal management bag to your cart now and enjoy your healthy meals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81My+95GtFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sisianti - Health In Style","source_asin":"B01FXNVTFI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-855901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FXNVTFI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FXNVTFI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
